expiry by 30 days for active non-revoked free keys, rate-limited per IP", "Expired key auth response includes actionable renewal guidance: renewal_hint field with URL and reason code 'key_expired_renewable'", "Optional: 7-day pre-expiry notification via the /v1/admin notification surface or webhook (not email — no email infra exists yet)", "Optional: extend free-tier default to 90 days OR make expiry configurable via env var FREE_KEY_TTL_DAYS", "No secrets exposed in renewal response; renewal requires the existing key to still be valid (not revoked)", "Rate limited: max 3 renewals per key per 24h to prevent abuse", "Admin can see approaching-expiry keys in dashboard snapshot"]	Add free-tier key renewal path and pre-expiry warning	## Problem\nFree-tier self-service API keys hard-expire in 30 days with no renewal mechanism. Users silently break at day 30.\n\n## Root Cause\n- src/routes/public.ts: self-service keygen hardcodes `new Date(Date.now() + 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000)`\n- src/auth.ts: expired keys return a generic message with no renewal path\n- No renewal endpoint exists anywhere in the codebase\n\n## Implementation\n1. Add POST /v1/keys/renew — accepts current valid key via Bearer auth, extends expiresAt by 30 days (or FREE_KEY_TTL_DAYS env), rate-limited to 3/24h per key\n2. Modify expired-key auth response in src/auth.ts to include: renewal_hint (URL), reason code 'key_expired_renewable', and documentation link\n3. Add env var FREE_KEY_TTL_DAYS (default 30) to make expiry configurable without code changes\n4. Add admin.dashboard.snapshot query for keys expiring within 7 days\n\n## Safety Gates\n- Renewal requires valid Bearer auth (existing key must not be revoked)\n- Rate limit: 3 renewals per key per 24h (Redis-backed, fail-closed)\n- No secrets returned beyond the existing key prefix\n- Dry-run supported via ?dry_run=true query param\n- Admin receipt written for each renewal\n- No billing/security/customer-contact mutations\n\n## Verification\n- POST /v1/keys/generate → get key → POST /v1/keys/renew with that key → verify expiresAt extended\n- Let key expire (or mock) → verify auth response includes renewal_hint\n- Verify rate limiting blocks >3 renewals/24h\n- Verify revoked keys cannot renew	triage	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-08-01 05:15:35.522	2026-08-01 05:15:35.522
