ins intentionally dark: remove execute:true from GET /skill examples, mark execute as unavailable in OpenAPI/ParseRequest, and set FEATURE_STATUS sandbox/execute to not-shipped with claims-lint pass", "Poll path never returns sandbox_status=unavailable with HTTP 200 success framing while skill still advertises execute:true", "Add a production canary: execute:true smoke asserts either real isolation or honest feature-disabled error; fails CI/deploy if skill/OpenAPI advertise execute while sandbox is dark", "No secrets printed in logs; no security-policy widening; no billing/price changes"]	Make execute:true honest — wire sandbox or kill the advertisement	## Problem\nHosted skill and OpenAPI advertise POST /v1/parse execute:true.\nLive production (2026-08-11) accepts execute:true, returns 202 + poll_url, then poll completes with:\nexecution.output = '[Execution skipped: sandbox not configured]'\nexecution.sandbox_status = 'unavailable', isolated = false.\nThis is demo theater, not a product.\n\n## Evidence\n- GET /skill includes execute:true example and async execute flow copy\n- OpenAPI ParseRequest.properties.execute documents sandbox execution\n- Live free key redis_* submit 202 execution_pending=true analysis_method=pattern\n- Live poll returns sandbox unavailable skip string\n\n## Desired end state (pick one, do not leave hybrid lies)\nA) Production sandbox configured and healthy: execute:true yields isolated:true and real output risk scoring\nB) Feature gated off: execute:true rejected with explicit feature-disabled error; skill/OpenAPI/FEATURE_STATUS updated the same commit\n\n## Implementation notes\n1. Inspect SANDBOX_URL / SANDBOX_HMAC_SECRET / sandbox-client runtime wiring in Railway\n2. If secrets missing: either provision sandbox service OR hard-disable execute path\n3. Update skill + OpenAPI + product-facts FEATURE_STATUS in the same change as behavior\n4. Add canary/test: advertise/execute consistency invariant\n\n## Safety gates\n- Do NOT implement silent auto-deploy of sandbox infra without Danny approval\n- Do NOT widen auth, CORS, or security policy as a side effect\n- Do NOT change billing/pricing/entitlements\n- Do NOT contact customers\n- Do NOT print sandbox HMAC secrets or API keys in receipts/logs\n- Prefer honest feature-disabled error over fake success if sandbox cannot ship this sprint\n- Production env/secret changes and deploys require Danny approval\n\n## Verification\n1. POST /v1/parse execute:true with throwaway key\n2. Confirm either isolated:true real run OR explicit disabled error (no skip theater)\n3. GET /skill and OpenAPI no longer claim a working execute path unless canary green\n4. npm run claims-lint / brand-lint pass if FEATURE_STATUS touched	triage	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Master Key:master	Master Key:master	2026-08-11 05:20:38.952	2026-08-11 05:20:38.952
