PI key auth unless it actually accepts keys", "Regression tests cover CTA href, Accept:text/html dashboard behavior, and admin-login cookie handoff; no secrets in logs or URLs", "Safety gates: no billing price changes, no webhook secret rotation, no public incident blog, no hard deletes; Stripe success_url may stay on /checkout/success"]	Fix post-pay success CTA + browser dashboard auth handoff for API-key customers	## Goal\nClose the post-Stripe identity handoff so a paying API-key customer can actually open billing/usage after checkout.\n\n## Evidence (prod www.parsethis.ai @ 2d81414, 2026-08-12 hourly loop)\n- POST /v1/billing/checkout solo/pro/team = 200 live Stripe URLs (checkout no longer the revenue blocker).\n- /checkout/success manual fallback CTA copy says API key but href=/login.\n- /login is email/password via POST /auth/login; api_key body returns 400.\n- Real API-key browser session is POST /admin/login -> parse_admin_key cookie.\n- Nav Sign in already points at /admin/login; success page disagrees.\n- /dashboard/* with Accept:text/html still returns application/problem+json 401.\n- Self-service keys are user_id=self-service with no password User row.\n\n## Implementation sketch (proposal only — do not implement in this loop)\n1. Change checkout-success manual CTA href from /login to /admin/login; align button copy.\n2. Optionally add paste-key field on success page that POSTs to /admin/login.\n3. Make authMiddleware browser branch: if Accept prefers HTML / is a navigation, redirect to /admin/login?next=... instead of problem+json.\n4. Verify pricing JS writes pfa_key for both bearer checkout and signup-checkout issued keys before redirecting to Stripe.\n5. Tests: CTA href unit/render test; HTML accept dashboard redirect test; admin login cookie handoff test.\n\n## Safety gates\n- Do NOT change Stripe prices, products, webhooks, or entitlements logic in this task unless needed only to read session tier for success page copy.\n- Do NOT rotate secrets, contact customers, or publish status/incident copy.\n- Do NOT remove /login email-password account auth; just stop sending API-key buyers there.\n- No hard deletes. Prefer redirect/HTML fix over new identity platform.\n\n## Verify\n- Manual: generate key -> checkout pro URL created -> open /checkout/success with pfa_key set -> lands on HTML /dashboard/billing.\n- Manual: clear storage -> /checkout/success shows key sign-in to /admin/login -> cookie -> dashboard HTML.\n- curl -H 'Accept: text/html' /dashboard/billing is not problem+json.	triage	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Master Key:master	Master Key:master	2026-08-12 02:27:53.397	2026-08-12 02:27:53.397
