OST /v1/chat: body=NONE — needs messages[]\n- POST /v1/analyze: body=NONE — accepts {content: string}\n\n## Fix\n1. Define request body schemas for all 4 missing endpoints\n2. Add schemas to components.schemas\n3. Write tests verifying documented shapes return non-400\n\n## Safety gates\n- Read-only documentation change\n- No billing/security/deploy mutation\n- Must not change runtime validation — only document it	triage	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-08-12 04:50:31.489	2026-08-12 04:50:31.489
